sequenceDiagram
  title Cache-miss request
  actor U as Shopper
  participant W as Web App
  participant A as Checkout API
  participant C as Redis cache
  participant D as Postgres
  U->>W: open cart
  W->>+A: GET /cart
  A->>C: GET cart:42
  C-->>A: miss
  alt cart exists
    A->>+D: SELECT cart
    D-->>-A: rows
    A-)C: SET cart:42 (ttl 60s)
  else no cart
    A->>A: create empty cart
  end
  Note over A,C: writes are async, reads never block on cache
  A-->>-W: 200 cart
  W-->>U: render
